The '''2024–25 season''' was the 95th season in the history of '''[[Girona FC|Girona Futbol Club]]''', and the club's third consecutive season in [[La Liga]]. In addition to the [[2024–25 La Liga|domestic league]], the club participated in the [[2024–25 Copa del Rey|Copa del Rey]] and made a debut appearance in the [[2024–25 UEFA Champions League|UEFA Champions League]], their first ever European competition participation.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.nytimes.com/athletic/5471698/2024/05/04/girona-champions-league/|title=Girona beat Barcelona to qualify for Champions League for first time|first=Callum|last=Davis|publisher=The New York Times|date=4 May 2024}}</ref>

